# Copy this file to .env and fill in your own Spotify application's Client ID.
#
# ROOMTONE does not ship with a Client ID. Spotify applications start in
# development mode, which only permits up to 25 hand-added users, so a shared
# ID would not work for you anyway. Registering your own takes two minutes:
#
#   1. Go to https://developer.spotify.com/dashboard and create an app.
#   2. Add the redirect URI:  http://127.0.0.1:8888/callback
#   3. Tick "Web API" under the SDKs question, and save.
#   4. Open the app > Settings > User Management and add your own account.
#   5. Copy the Client ID below.
#
# There is no client secret. ROOMTONE uses the PKCE flow, which does not need one.

SPOTIFY_CLIENT_ID=your_client_id_here
